@host = http://localhost:5088
@token = PASTE_JWT_HERE

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hung@example.com",
  "displayName": "Hung",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hung@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Create project
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PNH EFOOTBALL Demo",
  "slug": "pnh-efootball-demo",
  "sourceLocaleCode": "vi"
}

### Attach English
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/locales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "localeCode": "en" }

### Import nested source JSON
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/source-versions/import
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "versionName": "source-1.0.0",
  "data": {
    "home": { "title": "Trang chủ" },
    "login": { "button": "Đăng nhập" },
    "welcome": "Xin chào {name}"
  }
}

### List translations
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/translations?locale=en&status=missing
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save translation
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/translations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stringId": 1,
  "localeCode": "en",
  "value": "Home",
  "status": "translated",
  "expectedRowVersion": 0
}

### ===== Module Translation / Review / Release (Đức) =====

### Lọc bản dịch: status = missing|draft|translated|needs_review|approved, assignee = me|none|{userId}
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/translations?locale=en&q=login&status=&assignee=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tiến độ theo ngôn ngữ
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/translations/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Gửi review (placeholder phải khớp nguồn, sai => 400 kèm details.missing/extra)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/translations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stringId": 3,
  "localeCode": "en",
  "value": "Hello {name}",
  "status": "translated",
  "expectedRowVersion": 0
}

### Phân công hàng loạt (manager) — userId null = bỏ phân công
PUT {{host}}/api/projects/1/translations/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "localeCode": "en", "stringIds": [1, 2], "userId": 2 }

### Phân công một bản dịch đã có
PUT {{host}}/api/projects/1/translations/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "expectedRowVersion": 1 }

### Bình luận
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/translations/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Nên dùng thuật ngữ thống nhất" }

### Xem bình luận / lịch sử
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/translations/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/translations/1/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Duyệt (manager/reviewer) — expectedRowVersion sai => 409
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/translations/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": null, "expectedRowVersion": 2 }

### Từ chối (bắt buộc có note)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/translations/1/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Sai thuật ngữ", "expectedRowVersion": 2 }

### Validate release
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/releases/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Chốt phát hành (manager) — trùng phiên bản => 409
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/releases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "versionName": "1.0.0", "note": "Bản đầu tiên" }

### Danh sách / chi tiết release
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/releases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/releases/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tải file JSON một ngôn ngữ (header X-Content-SHA256)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/releases/1/files/en
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tải cả gói .zip (các file JSON + manifest.json)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/releases/1/download
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
